# Commit message attribution

When writing git commit messages for this repository:

- Never mention Cursor, Cursor Agent, Auto, Composer, or any Cursor product name.
- Do not include AI tool branding, model names, or IDE names in commit subjects or bodies.
- If attribution or assistance must be mentioned, write **coding agent** only.
- Prefer commit messages that describe the change with no AI/tool attribution at all.

```text
# BAD
Generated with Cursor
Co-authored-by: Cursor
Made by Cursor Agent / Auto / Composer

# GOOD (no attribution)
Add contact form validation with Yup

# GOOD (if attribution is required)
Assisted by coding agent
```
